    "detailed_description": "<strong>Idle Blocks</strong> is a simple idle clicker game with unique gameplay. Move your mouse over the blocks to deal damage. You can also click on the blocks or wait for an idle damage. <br><br>Destroy all blocks to complete the level and get money. Buy upgrades to deal more damage and complete more levels!<br><br>Feel stuck? Use a complex prestige system to buy super powerful permanent upgrades! Restart the game to apply purchases and you will get a fresh start, but with significantly increased powers!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>A relaxing idle clicker gameplay with various possibilities. Choose your own playthrough and spend hours with pleasure!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE AND UPGRADES</h2>Complex prestige system with 12 upgrades to make your progression smooth and enjoyable<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS</h2>50 unique color schemes for blocks and nice pixel UI for your satisfaction<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS</h2>50 Steam achievements for the most hardcore players. Will you be able to collect them all?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUSIC</h2>28 background music tracks for your relaxation <br><br><br><strong>Idle Blocks</strong> looks like a simple game, but it gives endless joy to those who dare to try it!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Idle Blocks</strong> is a simple idle clicker game with unique gameplay. Move your mouse over the blocks to deal damage. You can also click on the blocks or wait for an idle damage. <br><br>Destroy all blocks to complete the level and get money. Buy upgrades to deal more damage and complete more levels!<br><br>Feel stuck? Use a complex prestige system to buy super powerful permanent upgrades! Restart the game to apply purchases and you will get a fresh start, but with significantly increased powers!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>A relaxing idle clicker gameplay with various possibilities. Choose your own playthrough and spend hours with pleasure!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESTIGE AND UPGRADES</h2>Complex prestige system with 12 upgrades to make your progression smooth and enjoyable<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS</h2>50 unique color schemes for blocks and nice pixel UI for your satisfaction<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS</h2>50 Steam achievements for the most hardcore players. Will you be able to collect them all?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUSIC</h2>28 background music tracks for your relaxation <br><br><br><strong>Idle Blocks</strong> looks like a simple game, but it gives endless joy to those who dare to try it!",
    "short_description": "Idle clicker game with simple but really addictive gameplay. Destroy endless blocks and proceed as far as you can. Complex prestige system and upgrades with endless possibilities and pure fun",
